      "writtenOn": "2018-10-09T23:32:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Test *should* be hermetic, unfortunately Android has had a poor history of testing and there is no guarantees that everyone\u0027s tests behave properly.\n\n\nTo try and fight against the lack of hermetic tests, we have been playing whack-a-mole and adding \"checkers\" to detect bad device states:\nhttps://cs.corp.google.com/android/tools/tradefederation/core/src/com/android/tradefed/suite/checker/?dr\u003dCSs\u0026g\u003d0\n\n\nYou could create one for this check and add it to the test or the complete test mapping run:\nhttps://cs.corp.google.com/android/tools/tradefederation/core/res/config/suite/test_mapping_suite.xml?q\u003dtest_mapping\u0026sq\u003dpackage:%5Eandroid$\u0026dr\u003dC\u0026l\u003d16",
      "parentUuid": "4ef1e17f_81e61373",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 30,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 31,
        "endChar": 63
      },
      "revId": "ecf2a4a61731c50da8aaa21b7230696e719870a6",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
