      "writtenOn": "2018-10-10T18:35:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Well it depends. Some devices have sepolicy off by default (especially during bringup). Someone else might setenforce 0 in order to get a change they have working and then run your test.\n\nOne possible option would be to add an option to atest \u0027option name\u003d\"permissive\" value\u003d\"true\"\u0027, but I don\u0027t know how to do that.",
      "parentUuid": "6cd2ba87_418a0920",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 30,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 31,
        "endChar": 63
      },
